exports[`CommandOfficeRoom > mounts the unavailable Office landing through the Team view 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-team" data-shell-view="team"><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header" data-od-id="team-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="团队视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter-group="team-mode" data-filter="office" type="button"><span>办公室</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter-group="team-mode" data-filter="workflow" type="button"><span>协作流</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter-group="team-mode" data-filter="experts" type="button"><span>专家团</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索办公室"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索办公室、目标或成员" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button" type="button">同步真实数据</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="office">创建办公室</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="workflow" disabled="" hidden="" title="等待 Workflow 后端列表、创建与运行接口接入">创建协作流</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="experts" disabled="" hidden="" title="等待专家团定义与单聊运行接口接入">创建专家团</button></div></header><section class="catalog-source-bar" data-od-id="team-filters-inline"><label class="team-workspace-scope"><span class="team-workspace-scope-label">办公室工作空间</span><span class="team-workspace-picker"><select aria-label="办公室群聊工作空间" title="/repo/team"><option value="/repo/team" selected="">team</option></select><span class="team-workspace-path" title="/repo/team">/repo/team</span></span></label><span class="catalog-context-note team-workspace-note">群聊空间 · 可 @ 任意员工 · 不影响主页单聊</span></section><section class="team-office-shell" data-card-filter="office" data-office-shell="" data-od-id="team-office-shell"><div class="office-card-grid" data-office-list="" aria-label="办公室卡片"><section aria-labelledby="_R_b_" class="team-office-empty" data-office-empty-state="unavailable"><header class="team-office-empty-head"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">OFFICE RUNTIME</span><h3 id="_R_b_">办公室运行态暂未连接</h3><p>连接 App Server 后，这里会展示当前工作空间的真实办公室；不会使用演示数据替代。</p></header><div aria-label="办公室能力" class="team-office-capability-grid"><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square-text"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M13 8H7"></path><path d="M17 12H7"></path></svg></span><div><strong>群聊</strong><p>向组长或指定员工发送消息，持续保留同一条协作主线。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks"><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="M13 6h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 18h8"></path></svg></span><div><strong>执行台</strong><p>查看排队、执行、确认与完成状态，保持任务进度可追踪。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain-circuit"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M12 13h4"></path><path d="M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path><path d="M12 8h8"></path><path d="M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2"></path><circle cx="16" cy="13" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="3" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="21" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="8" r=".5"></circle></svg></span><div><strong>记忆与上下文</strong><p>沉淀办公室范围内的事实、偏好和决策，并控制可见边界。</p></div></article></div><footer class="team-office-empty-footer"><span class="team-office-connection-state" data-state="unavailable" role="status">App Server 未连接</span><button class="button" type="button">重新连接</button></footer></section></div><section class="office-room-inline team-office-runtime-room" data-office-room="" hidden="" tabindex="-1"><div class="team-office-room-loading" role="status">正在连接办公室运行态…</div></section></section><section class="team-workflow-shell" data-card-filter="workflow" data-od-id="team-workflow-shell" data-workflow-shell="" hidden=""><section class="team-office-empty team-capability-unavailable" data-team-capability-state="backend-unavailable"><header class="team-office-empty-head"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">REAL RUNTIME REQUIRED</span><h3>协作流真实运行态尚未接入</h3><p>当前 App Server 尚未提供协作流的列表、创建和运行接口。前端不会再用静态节点、假进度或本地消息模拟成功。</p></header><div class="team-office-capability-grid" aria-label="接入要求"><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>真实定义</strong><p>只展示服务端返回的配置、成员和授权资源。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>真实运行态</strong><p>创建、执行、恢复和状态更新全部经过 App Server。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>协作流运行工作空间</strong><p title="/repo/team">/repo/team</p></div></article></div><footer class="team-office-empty-footer"><span class="team-office-connection-state" data-state="unavailable" role="status">未展示演示数据，创建入口已安全关闭</span></footer></section></section><section class="team-experts-shell" data-card-filter="experts" data-od-id="team-experts-shell" hidden=""><section class="team-office-empty team-capability-unavailable" data-team-capability-state="backend-unavailable"><header class="team-office-empty-head"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">REAL RUNTIME REQUIRED</span><h3>专家团真实单聊运行态尚未接入</h3><p>专家团属于单聊执行目标，但当前还没有真实的专家团定义、团长会话和后台成员运行接口。前端不会生成罐头回复或虚构后台协作。</p></header><div class="team-office-capability-grid" aria-label="接入要求"><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>真实定义</strong><p>只展示服务端返回的配置、成员和授权资源。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>真实运行态</strong><p>创建、执行、恢复和状态更新全部经过 App Server。</p></div></article><article class="team-office-capability"><div><strong>专家团单聊工作空间</strong><p title="/repo/personal">/repo/personal</p></div></article></div><footer class="team-office-empty-footer"><span class="team-office-connection-state" data-state="unavailable" role="status">未展示演示数据，创建入口已安全关闭</span></footer></section></section><div id="team-log" class="sr-log" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>"`;

